          "title": "You'll want to know: справка",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "справка (správka) — \"a certificate, an official note; information\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Для визы нужна справка с работы. Dlya vízy nuzhná správka s rabóty. For the visa you need a letter from your employer."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Справочное бюро — an information desk."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "справка (správka) is built on справиться 'to inquire', from править 'to set right, to put in order'. EtymDB lists справка (správka) without a deeper source."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
